WEBVTT

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:05.010
Hey! Oliver, what's wrong?!

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:06.040
Hang in there--

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:21.940
There's no one chasing us now.

00:00:22.390 --> 00:00:23.390
Levi.

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:32.830
Everyone got turned into a Titan.

00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:35.150
But you alone survived.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.920
It must be for the same reason why
you're still alive even with such an injury.

00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:42.340
Because you're an Ackerman.

00:00:57.150 --> 00:01:00.300
What to do now?

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:04.140
It's not like we can stop
Zeke with just the two of us.

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:07.340
Guess we can only leave it to
Armin or Commander Pixis now...

00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:11.520
Even if Eren betrayed Zeke,

00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:16.160
the Yeagerist will still rule
this island with the spinal fluid.

00:01:16.160 --> 00:01:20.060
And we'll be on the run on this island
for the rest of our life.

00:01:22.370 --> 00:01:25.380
Perhaps it's simply our turn.

00:01:25.470 --> 00:01:28.810
Even though we think
we're doing the right thing...

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:33.880
Once the time changes,
we'll find ourselves in the cells.

00:01:35.180 --> 00:01:37.830
Maybe we should just live here together.

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:40.220
What do you think, Levi?

00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:47.660
That was... It can't be....

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:49.900
Eren's destroying the whole world?

00:01:49.950 --> 00:01:51.060
Levi!

00:01:52.650 --> 00:01:55.230
That Beast piece of shit...

00:01:55.830 --> 00:01:56.960
Where is he?

00:01:56.980 --> 00:01:58.710
You should lie down.

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:02.120
Zeke headed to Shiganshina
together with the Yeagerist.

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:04.360
Half a day has passed since then.

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:06.860
Just what happened?

00:02:07.530 --> 00:02:08.920
I screwed up.

00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:10.800
I failed...

00:02:10.820 --> 00:02:14.860
...to notice his resolve
to die for his cause.

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:18.240
I let him get away, again.

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:20.540
I'm sure you want to get your revenge.

00:02:21.010 --> 00:02:21.870
But now--

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:25.070
If we just... run away
and keep on hiding...

00:02:25.090 --> 00:02:26.430
What will we have left?

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:32.130
Oh, so you heard me talking to myself.

00:02:32.410 --> 00:02:34.710
What are you making?

00:02:35.310 --> 00:02:39.100
Are you planning to carry me
with that by horse?

00:02:39.810 --> 00:02:44.380
I know you're not the type who
can stay still outside of the action.

00:02:44.550 --> 00:02:46.650
Yeah, you're right.

00:02:47.010 --> 00:02:48.170
I can't.

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:54.250
My goal is to kill Zeke.

00:02:55.340 --> 00:02:58.000
Our interests align.

00:02:58.100 --> 00:03:00.800
Theo Magath. Pieck Finger.

00:03:07.470 --> 00:03:09.210
Levi Ackerman.

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:13.620
I've heard your skill rivaled
even that of the Nine Titans.

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:15.140
But look at you now.

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:17.940
How do you intend to dodge my bullet?

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:20.040
I can't dodge any bullet.

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:24.130
But I've presented myself
in this miserable state to my enemy.

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:27.060
Will you shoot, or will you listen?

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:29.100
It's up to you.

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:37.280
Then let me ask you before I shoot.

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:40.020
You said you'd kill Zeke.

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:41.850
Where is he right now?

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:47.290
I believe Eren has absorbed him
so he can make use of his Royal Blood.

00:03:47.470 --> 00:03:50.010
Or should I say,
the Founding Titan absorbed him.

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:54.450
It seems like you know everything
about Titan, Prof. Hange.

00:03:54.450 --> 00:03:56.320
Even more so than Marley.

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:59.830
Have you seen this Founding Titan
for yourself?

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:04.860
I know it's unbelievably large
and seemed impossible to beat.

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:06.350
Which is why...

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:08.800
We have to do this together.

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:12.630
Let's combine our forces.

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:16.400
<b><i>Rumbling, Rumbling, it's coming</i></b>

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:19.310
<b><i>Rumbling, Rumbling</i></b>

00:04:19.310 --> 00:04:22.280
<b><i>Beware</i></b>

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:28.700
<b><i>Coming for you</i></b>

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:36.670
<b><i>All I ever wanted to do was do right things</i></b>

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:41.340
<b><i>I've never wanted to be the king, I swear</i></b>

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:46.300
<b><i>All I ever wanted to do was save your life</i></b>

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:51.430
<b><i>I've never wanted to grab a knife, I swear</i></b>

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:59.860
<b><i>Tearless, fearless, burning, burning</i></b>

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:03.110
<b><i>You tell me what have I missed</i></b>

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:06.700
<b><i>Still wandering in the deep mist</i></b>

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:12.740
<b><i>If I lose it all, slip and fall</i></b>

00:05:12.740 --> 00:05:15.580
<b><i>I will never look away</i></b>

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:21.500
<b><i>If I lose it all, lose it all, lose it all</i></b>

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:25.420
<b><i>If I lose it all outside the wall</i></b>

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:28.760
<b><i>Live to die another day</i></b>

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:31.140
<b><i>I don't want anything</i></b>

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:34.520
<b><i>I'm just here to...</i></b>

00:05:35.470 --> 00:05:38.560
<b><i>Beware</i></b>

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:48.030
Pride

00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:29.590
What should I do to feed
Falco to my mom?

00:06:30.060 --> 00:06:32.100
Should I do it by force?

00:06:32.810 --> 00:06:37.320
It'll be over for me if I injured him and
let him realize he has Titan power.

00:06:37.860 --> 00:06:39.520
I can't afford making any mistake.

00:06:40.030 --> 00:06:43.650
I need to think of a good idea.

00:06:46.040 --> 00:06:48.120
He's a good boy.

00:06:48.980 --> 00:06:52.260
He didn't say anything when
I say we'll be camping out here.

00:06:52.950 --> 00:06:55.040
He should've been more suspicious of me.

00:06:56.880 --> 00:06:58.830
Does he really trust me?

00:06:59.380 --> 00:07:00.500
A guy like me?

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:03.050
Dammit!

00:07:03.470 --> 00:07:04.880
Sasha...

00:07:05.600 --> 00:07:07.850
Would you understand how I feel?

00:07:15.470 --> 00:07:18.660
Umm, I thought we were going to a hospital.

00:07:19.270 --> 00:07:20.990
Why are we in an abandoned village?

00:07:21.280 --> 00:07:24.070
Well, there's something interesting here.

00:07:24.100 --> 00:07:25.760
So I want to show it to you.

00:07:28.780 --> 00:07:31.220
Is this... Ragako?

00:07:33.650 --> 00:07:36.340
How... did you know?

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:38.310
Last night...

00:07:38.790 --> 00:07:41.230
I heard you talking to yourself.

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:44.350
Sasha...

00:07:44.660 --> 00:07:48.660
She's your friend whom Gabi shot
back in the airship, isn't she?

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:52.360
Even though you knew who I am...

00:07:52.800 --> 00:07:55.330
You pretended you didn't know me
and brought me here.

00:07:56.420 --> 00:07:57.820
Why is that?

00:07:58.430 --> 00:08:01.380
Do you want to have your revenge on me?

00:08:01.570 --> 00:08:02.740
No.

00:08:02.970 --> 00:08:06.450
I'm aware that it was all
under the heat of battle.

00:08:20.200 --> 00:08:22.030
Don't worry, she can't move.

00:08:22.550 --> 00:08:25.760
She has been like this for years now.

00:08:28.300 --> 00:08:33.290
What do you intend to do...
by showing me this?

00:08:47.560 --> 00:08:50.860
I want you to help me brush her teeth.

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:54.100
It's not often you get to experience
something like this!

00:08:58.670 --> 00:08:59.670
Eh?

00:08:59.700 --> 00:09:00.790
See that?

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:03.260
You just have to scrub her
from up on that beam.

00:09:03.490 --> 00:09:06.070
Let's first climb up there,
and then think about it.

00:09:06.340 --> 00:09:08.700
Please. You can do it, right?

00:09:09.780 --> 00:09:10.870
Yes...

00:09:11.350 --> 00:09:13.650
Falco! Get away from him!

00:09:13.790 --> 00:09:14.680
Gabi?!

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:17.080
He's trying to feed you to that Titan!

00:09:18.060 --> 00:09:19.590
Connie! Stop it!

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:20.890
Stop there!

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:22.580
Stay back!

00:09:25.440 --> 00:09:26.600
Connie!

00:09:26.630 --> 00:09:27.770
Shut up!

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:29.060
I don't want to hear you!

00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:30.220
Don't say anything!

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:31.970
You wouldn't know how I feel!

00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:34.700
You're going to tell me it's better
to keep him alive, right?!

00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:36.870
That's why I should give up
on my mom, right?!

00:09:37.110 --> 00:09:41.050
I'm sure someone as righteous as you
wouldn't understand an idiot like me!

00:09:41.800 --> 00:09:44.340
Falco! Use the power of the Jaw!

00:09:44.920 --> 00:09:46.400
The power of the Jaw?

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:49.130
What happened to Mr. Galliard?

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:53.640
No way... Stop!

00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:54.960
Falco!

00:09:58.830 --> 00:10:01.860
Gabi, please forgive Connie.

00:10:09.910 --> 00:10:12.430
Hey! I said stay back!

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:25.550
Hey...

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:27.250
What are you planning to do?

00:10:29.050 --> 00:10:31.200
Say something, Armin!

00:10:31.220 --> 00:10:33.560
You told me to shut up, didn't you!

00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:35.930
That's why...

00:10:36.340 --> 00:10:38.410
I'll show you through my action.

00:11:02.650 --> 00:11:03.850
Colt...

00:11:05.690 --> 00:11:09.560
What would you do if I hadn't saved you?

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:13.650
Your mother would've
turned back into a human.

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:17.620
And she'll inherit the Colossal Titan.

00:11:18.100 --> 00:11:23.520
I should've known that it'll just
end up making her suffer more.

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:31.160
My mom sent me off,
telling me to be a good soldier.

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:33.270
And yet, his son...

00:11:33.850 --> 00:11:37.020
He was so close to killing children
and his own friend.

00:11:37.940 --> 00:11:41.830
That's the kind of soldier
that I've become.

00:11:43.790 --> 00:11:45.280
So do I.

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:48.040
I couldn't become Commander's replacement.

00:11:53.510 --> 00:11:54.680
Armin.

00:11:55.850 --> 00:11:59.370
I want to be a soldier
my mom can be proud of.

00:12:03.520 --> 00:12:07.680
Let's go save those in need.

00:12:18.910 --> 00:12:20.370
I looked everywhere.

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:22.230
I'm glad.

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:26.500
Were you looking for me?

00:12:27.240 --> 00:12:30.260
Or perhaps this scarf?

00:12:30.590 --> 00:12:32.580
I figured you're the one who took it.

00:12:33.090 --> 00:12:34.370
I'm sorry.

00:12:34.700 --> 00:12:38.370
I thought it'd bring me closer to you.

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:44.480
There's a Thunder Spear fragment
inside of my stomach.

00:12:44.500 --> 00:12:46.240
They say they couldn't take it out.

00:12:46.970 --> 00:12:49.980
It's a pity that I'll never get to see...

00:12:49.980 --> 00:12:54.340
the free world that
Eren Yeager will make...

00:12:57.030 --> 00:13:01.680
I had a chance to talk with
Mr. Yeager for a short time.

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:03.530
It was about you.

00:13:05.320 --> 00:13:09.570
He wanted me to throw away this scarf.

00:13:12.130 --> 00:13:14.920
But if this scarf will end up in a dump...

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:16.970
I could just bring it...

00:13:16.970 --> 00:13:18.080
Give it back.

00:13:23.560 --> 00:13:27.430
I became a soldier because I admired you.

00:13:30.650 --> 00:13:33.240
I have no regrets.

00:13:35.430 --> 00:13:37.840
Because I lived...

00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:41.530
...dedicating my heart to chase after you.

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:50.670
That Titan must be
the last in the line of the Rumbling.

00:13:51.270 --> 00:13:54.370
Finally we can be free
of these rumbling noises.

00:13:55.800 --> 00:14:00.140
It was like the sound of bells,
announcing our freedom.

00:14:02.810 --> 00:14:09.500
Our Eldian Empire has been persecuted
by the world for over a century!

00:14:10.270 --> 00:14:11.730
But it's now over!

00:14:12.420 --> 00:14:14.340
Now, we're free!

00:14:15.130 --> 00:14:18.330
It was thanks to Eren, our liberator,
and us, the Yeagerist!

00:14:18.570 --> 00:14:20.570
We've won against the world!

00:14:23.740 --> 00:14:25.430
Hey, Mikasa.

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:29.930
Are you gonna join the Yeagerists
and become one of our rulers?

00:14:30.120 --> 00:14:31.520
Not interested.

00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:34.210
But it sure looks like
Jean is all up for it.

00:14:34.240 --> 00:14:36.240
Dedicate your heart!

00:14:36.260 --> 00:14:37.990
Dedicate your heart!

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:39.700
Dedicate your heart!

00:14:39.720 --> 00:14:41.380
Dedicate your heart!

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:43.190
Dedicate your heart!

00:14:43.210 --> 00:14:45.700
Dedicate your heart!

00:14:45.730 --> 00:14:47.750
Long live the Yeagerist!

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:49.670
Dedicate your heart!

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:52.390
I'm dedicating this drink to Eren!

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:55.450
Anyway, we must hurry up
and get to where Reiner is.

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:59.080
He'll be in a coma for two or three days,
so don't worry.

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:02.030
Should we really take this detour?

00:15:02.030 --> 00:15:04.240
We need to fill our stomachs first.

00:15:05.700 --> 00:15:07.970
But are you sure about this, Armin?

00:15:08.270 --> 00:15:09.330
Yeah.

00:15:09.330 --> 00:15:13.520
If all hardening has been undone,
Annie should now also--

00:15:16.610 --> 00:15:18.450
A-Annie?!

00:15:19.840 --> 00:15:20.630
Eh?

00:15:27.090 --> 00:15:30.030
Annie's gobbling down a pie!

00:15:32.270 --> 00:15:34.150
Cut it out, Connie.

00:15:34.150 --> 00:15:35.900
What a sloppy eater!

00:15:35.920 --> 00:15:38.100
She hasn't eaten one in four years!

00:15:38.840 --> 00:15:41.730
Sorry, the line was real long.

00:15:42.680 --> 00:15:44.240
And she's gone.

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:47.350
Dear Hitch.

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:50.910
I happened to meet Armin and Connie,

00:15:50.910 --> 00:15:53.200
so I decided to join them.

00:15:53.690 --> 00:15:55.050
I'll be going first.

00:15:55.450 --> 00:15:56.800
I'm sorry for all the trouble.

00:15:58.090 --> 00:16:01.330
Thank you for talking to me
these four years.

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:03.040
Good bye.

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:06.120
Sincerely, your gloomy roommate.

00:16:14.680 --> 00:16:16.150
Good grief.

00:16:16.150 --> 00:16:18.480
Now how am I supposed
to eat this by myself?

00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:21.940
People of the empire!

00:16:21.940 --> 00:16:24.060
Thank you for gathering here today!

00:16:24.590 --> 00:16:28.330
We will now execute these two Volunteers

00:16:28.330 --> 00:16:30.940
who dared to turn against
the Eldian Empire!

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:37.740
With this, we Yeagerist will inherit
Eren's wishes to rule the world!

00:16:37.950 --> 00:16:41.780
And declare our reign
over this island of Paradis!

00:16:45.640 --> 00:16:47.700
This criminal is named Yelena!

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:50.360
She rebelled against Marley,

00:16:50.420 --> 00:16:53.750
and supported the Eldian Empire
with an ulterior motive!

00:16:53.980 --> 00:16:56.650
Her goal was to hand the power
of the Founding to Zeke,

00:16:56.650 --> 00:16:59.260
and to make his Euthanasia plan
into reality,

00:16:59.290 --> 00:17:02.540
thus wiping out every single
Eldian from existence!

00:17:02.770 --> 00:17:05.720
In the end, she's always
just a filthy Marleyan!

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:10.530
Eren has defeated Zeke
and stopped their plan.

00:17:10.910 --> 00:17:14.690
But this criminal has acted as
Zeke's faithful servant all along!

00:17:14.710 --> 00:17:15.870
Die, you harlot!

00:17:15.870 --> 00:17:17.870
Go to hell where you belong!

00:17:18.420 --> 00:17:19.590
Yelena!

00:17:19.840 --> 00:17:21.700
Do you have any last words?

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:24.140
You're not going to shoot yet?

00:17:24.170 --> 00:17:25.660
Die, mainlander!

00:17:25.680 --> 00:17:27.860
You were never a match
for us, the Subjects of Ymir!

00:17:27.890 --> 00:17:30.620
Only those with Ymir's blood will survive!

00:17:30.640 --> 00:17:33.840
Shoot! Shoot! Shoot!

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:37.150
Shoot! Shoot! Shoot!

00:17:37.180 --> 00:17:38.810
- Shoot!
- I'm not shooting just yet!

00:17:43.730 --> 00:17:46.240
The criminal is named Onyankopon.

00:17:46.240 --> 00:17:51.830
He worked well for Eldia,
ignorant of the Euthanasia plan!

00:17:51.830 --> 00:17:57.550
However, he dared say he'd choose death
over a life under the Eldian Empire!

00:17:57.920 --> 00:17:59.970
If you've changed your mind,
now is your time--

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:07.750
I assisted Eldia to save
my homeland from Marley.

00:18:07.780 --> 00:18:10.720
That was also to help you all!

00:18:10.720 --> 00:18:13.310
And as a result of that...

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:16.230
My homeland will be trampled,

00:18:16.230 --> 00:18:18.600
and my family will be slaughtered.

00:18:18.600 --> 00:18:19.860
And now?

00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:24.420
The only ones left are a bunch of
pathetic xenophobic scoundrels!

00:18:26.610 --> 00:18:30.490
Life is not worth living if it means
I'd have to flatter the likes of you!

00:18:30.490 --> 00:18:32.910
All of you should already know
how unreasonable it is

00:18:32.940 --> 00:18:35.890
to be killed in a sudden,
indiscriminate murder!

00:18:36.020 --> 00:18:39.250
Why don't you guys understand that?!

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:42.990
Don't just stand there!
Say something, Jean!

00:18:57.930 --> 00:18:59.190
Huh?

00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:00.770
Hey.

00:19:02.060 --> 00:19:04.450
Oh shoot, I missed.

00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:07.780
What... are you doing?

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:12.960
Floch!

00:19:22.030 --> 00:19:23.630
It's the Cart Titan!

00:19:23.650 --> 00:19:24.380
They got away!

00:19:24.400 --> 00:19:26.050
- It ate Jean!
- Yelena, too!

00:19:26.080 --> 00:19:27.360
Damn it!

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:28.740
Where's Mikasa?

00:19:29.150 --> 00:19:31.070
Hurry up and get her...

00:19:33.030 --> 00:19:36.080
Where is Mikasa?

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:38.930
Did you hear that?

00:19:38.930 --> 00:19:41.350
Four gunshots in a row.

00:19:41.960 --> 00:19:44.080
That's our signal from Jean.

00:19:44.520 --> 00:19:47.410
We've got plenty of weapons
and food packed already.

00:19:47.440 --> 00:19:50.370
Their attention should be
all on the other side of the fort.

00:19:50.720 --> 00:19:51.780
Let's go!

00:20:03.080 --> 00:20:04.520
Somebody is watching us!

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:09.090
What should we do, Armin?

00:20:09.090 --> 00:20:10.720
We just have to keep going!

00:20:10.720 --> 00:20:12.090
Let's hurry, Mikasa!

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:27.620
I'm not getting into
a Titan's mouth ever again!

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:32.070
The Cart can stay in Titan form
for months at a time, right?

00:20:32.070 --> 00:20:34.050
Do you brush your teeth?

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:37.100
That's very rude to say to a lady.

00:20:37.780 --> 00:20:40.700
Since when did you
join forces with Marley?

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:42.370
Last night.

00:20:42.370 --> 00:20:43.850
Are you okay with this?

00:20:43.870 --> 00:20:48.950
Your position would have been secured
if you'd stayed with the Yeagerists.

00:20:51.780 --> 00:20:56.970
I wished I could've just cooped up
in my room with my ears shut.

00:20:57.830 --> 00:20:58.830
But...

00:20:59.970 --> 00:21:03.930
If I had, that burnt ashes of the dead
would never have forgiven me.

00:21:04.520 --> 00:21:05.650
Jean...

00:21:06.900 --> 00:21:09.190
I don't really understand
what you're saying.

00:21:09.190 --> 00:21:10.400
But thank you.

00:21:11.280 --> 00:21:13.650
Just wash yourself already.

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:17.820
Why did you save me as well?

00:21:17.820 --> 00:21:22.960
Securing you was part of the deal
to borrow the Cart's power.

00:21:23.940 --> 00:21:26.610
They wanted to have you alive.

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:36.020
Wake up.

00:21:42.480 --> 00:21:43.610
Annie!

00:21:46.770 --> 00:21:48.400
Calm down, Reiner.

00:21:48.520 --> 00:21:49.910
Don't worry.

00:21:49.970 --> 00:21:51.210
We're all on the same side.

00:21:52.690 --> 00:21:54.160
We have no time.

00:21:54.410 --> 00:21:55.620
Let's go.

00:21:56.820 --> 00:21:58.040
To where?

00:22:02.690 --> 00:22:04.620
To save the world.

00:22:10.460 --> 00:22:13.150
<b><i>The iron bullet is the proof of justice</i></b>

00:22:13.150 --> 00:22:15.730
<b><i>If it pierces through,
I'll be closer to being a hero</i></b>

00:22:15.730 --> 00:22:18.450
<b><i>But when I close my eyes and touch</i></b>

00:22:18.450 --> 00:22:22.990
<b><i>I notice that the devil
was no different from me</i></b>

00:22:23.780 --> 00:22:26.450
<b><i>Why am I not good, but he's okay?</i></b>

00:22:26.450 --> 00:22:29.160
<b><i>The only thing that
separates us was the wall</i></b>

00:22:29.160 --> 00:22:31.830
<b><i>Don't lament on the fate that we're born</i></b>

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:35.710
<b><i>Because we're all free</i></b>

00:22:35.710 --> 00:22:40.970
<b><i>If only I have wings like birds</i></b>

00:22:40.970 --> 00:22:46.310
<b><i>I can go anywhere I want</i></b>

00:22:46.310 --> 00:22:50.390
<b><i>But if I don't have a place to return to</i></b>

00:22:50.390 --> 00:22:55.820
<b><i>I'm sure I can't go anywhere</i></b>

00:22:55.820 --> 00:23:00.780
<b><i>I don't want to just live</i></b>

00:23:01.160 --> 00:23:11.830
<b><i>The world is cruel, but I still love you</i></b>

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:21.930
<b><i>I will sacrifice anything to protect you</i></b>

00:23:21.930 --> 00:23:27.140
<b><i>Even if it's a mistake to do so,
I'll not doubt my actions</i></b>

00:23:27.140 --> 00:23:33.560
<b><i>Because the right thing
is to firmly believe in yourself</i></b>

00:23:41.090 --> 00:23:44.260
<b>The flame of war has brought us enemies.</b>

00:23:44.390 --> 00:23:48.620
<b>It makes us hate, despise,
and kill each other</b>

00:23:48.770 --> 00:23:51.840
<b>So then, what will the bonfire bring us?</b>

00:23:52.040 --> 00:23:54.770
<b>Next time, "Night of the End."</b>
